#: ../../../reference/interfaces/lxd-interface.md:2
msgid "lxd interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/lxd-interface.md:4
msgid ""
"`lxd` allows access to the LXD API via the socket provided by the *lxd* "
"snap. *LXD_DIR* must be set to `/var/snap/lxd/common/lxd`. This interface "
"requires manual connection."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/lxd-interface.md:6
msgid ""
"**{ref}`Auto-connect <explanation-interfaces-interface-auto-connection>`**: "
"no</br> **{ref}`Super-privileged <reference-operations-interfaces-super-"
"privileged-interfaces>`**: yes</br>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/lxd-interface.md:6
msgid "</br>"
msgstr ""
